      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Weekly report (Mondays 09:00)\nCounts the last 7 days from **Events** (imported, drafted, approved, sent, follow-ups, replies by category, bounces, unsubscribes) plus the current pipeline from **Prospects**, asks Gemini for a 3-line insight, and emails an HTML report to REPORT_EMAIL.\n\nThe 09:00 uses the workflow timezone (**Settings → Timezone**, set to Asia/Kolkata in this file).",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
